# Photo Detail Sheet

::summary
The photo detail sheet, opened from the Files Photos grid tiles: a full-width image hero at the top, then upload date, editable description, the editable AI-generated caption, and tag chips (tap to filter the grid).
::

::modal[name=photo-detail title="surfspace-hero-dark.png" width=360 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::figure[src=surfspace-hero-dark.png caption="Full-width image hero at the top of the sheet"]
:::

:::row[icon=doc state=readonly href=#]
Uploaded
Aug 02, 2026
:::

:::row[icon=doc action=editPhotoDescription href=#]
Description
Dark-mode hero shot for the store listing
:::

:::row[icon=sparkle action=editAiDescription href=#]
AI description
Auto-generated caption; editable
:::

:::row[icon=knowledge action=filterByTag href=#]
Tags
store · hero · dark — chips, tap to filter
:::

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. Tag chips render as row meta here; tapping one closes the sheet and filters the Photos grid to that tag.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) this media sheet goes FULL-BLEED — edge-to-edge with no side insets, the image hero filling the viewport width — not the generic 10px-inset treatment; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
